{
  "intro": "Looking for a hotel near Syracuse, NY? The Cicero Grand sits at I-81 Exit 30 \u2014 inside the 15-mile circle that holds everything Syracuse is known for. The JMA Wireless Dome, the Empower FCU Amphitheater, the Oncenter, the State Fairgrounds, NBT Bank Stadium, Syracuse University, Le Moyne, Destiny USA, the Micron build site, and Hancock International Airport are all 6 to 17 minutes from our front door. This is our locals' guide to Syracuse \u2014 what to do, where to eat, and what's worth driving for. If a friend was visiting, this is what we'd tell them.",
  "seoBlurb": "The Cicero Grand is one of the closest hotels to Micron, Destiny USA, the JMA Wireless Dome, the Empower FCU Amphitheater at Lakeview, the New York State Fairgrounds, and Syracuse Hancock International Airport. Every suite sleeps four with a separate living area, free hot breakfast, indoor heated pool, free parking, and pet-friendly rooms.",
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "What's the closest hotel to Micron in Syracuse?",
      "a": "The Cicero Grand is six minutes from the Micron megafab campus in Clay, NY \u2014 making us one of the closest full-service hotels to the build site. We host project crews, vendors, and visiting engineers with extended-stay rates, direct billing, and free truck and trailer parking."
    },
    {
      "q": "How far is The Cicero Grand from Syracuse Hancock International Airport (SYR)?",
      "a": "Fourteen minutes by car. We're a straight shot south on I-81 from the airport, with no tolls. Park free in our lot during your stay or while you fly."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is The Cicero Grand close to Destiny USA?",
      "a": "Yes \u2014 twelve minutes south on I-81 to Destiny USA, New York's largest shopping center with 250+ stores, restaurants, and entertainment."
    },
    {
      "q": "How far are we from the JMA Wireless Dome and Syracuse University?",
      "a": "Sixteen minutes to the JMA Wireless Dome and the SU campus. We're a popular choice for SU football, basketball, and lacrosse weekends, parents weekends, recruiting visits, and graduations."
    },
    {
      "q": "How close is the hotel to the Empower FCU Amphitheater at Lakeview?",
      "a": "Twelve minutes. The Empower Federal Credit Union Amphitheater at Lakeview holds 17,500 fans and hosts the biggest summer concerts in Central New York. We're one of the closest hotels for show nights without paying downtown rates."
    },
    {
      "q": "How close are we to the New York State Fairgrounds?",
      "a": "Thirteen minutes. The Great New York State Fair (late August through Labor Day) draws nearly a million visitors. The Fairgrounds also host the Syracuse Nationals car show, the Expo Center events, and concerts year-round."
    },
    {
      "q": "What's the closest hotel to the Oncenter and War Memorial?",
      "a": "Fifteen minutes. The Oncenter complex covers the convention center, Crouse-Hinds Theater, the Upstate Medical University Arena (Syracuse Crunch hockey), and the War Memorial \u2014 all in downtown Syracuse off I-81."
    },
    {
      "q": "Where should I eat near the hotel?",
      "a": "Cracker Barrel is across the street. Twin Trees Cicero (legendary thin-crust pizza), Sal's Birdland (local fried-chicken classic), Cooper-Top Tavern, Hafner's, and Sardo's Pizza are all five minutes away on Route 11 / Route 31. Heid's of Liverpool (white hots since 1917) is eight minutes."
    },
    {
      "q": "What's the Syracuse food I have to try?",
      "a": "Three things: salt potatoes (boiled in brine, drowned in butter \u2014 a CNY original), chicken riggies (Utica\u2010style pasta with cherry peppers and cream), and a half-moon cookie from Harrison Bakery. Bonus: a white hot from Heid's."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is the hotel close to Turning Stone Casino?",
      "a": "Thirty-five minutes east on I-90. We're one of the closest non\u2010Turning Stone hotels for guests attending shows or events. Two more casinos \u2014 Yellow Brick Road in Chittenango and Point Place in Bridgeport \u2014 are 15\u201320 minutes away."
    }
  ],
